---
---

<section class="section quote">
  <div class="container quote__inner" data-reveal>
    <img
      class="quote__headshot"
      src="/images/suleman-alli-headshot.jpg"
      alt="Suleman Alli"
      width="120"
      height="120"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <blockquote>
      <p>
        "What struck me about the CHIME solution was that 100% of the people involved in the
        selection process — real business people, not procurement folks, but operational people —
        said they could use it in their roles tomorrow. And 98% said it was an improvement on the
        current solution."
      </p>
      <footer>
        <cite>Suleman Alli</cite> — Director of Customer Service, Strategy, Regulation and
        Technology at UK Power Networks
      </footer>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .quote {
    background: var(--color-grey-100);
  }

  .quote__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-gutter);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 56rem;
  }

  .quote__headshot {
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  blockquote p {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  blockquote footer {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-grey-600);
  }

  blockquote cite {
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
</style>
